BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Snugfest
DTSTART:20260913T113000
DTEND:20260913T210000
DTSTAMP:20260913T145649Z
UID:fd074ee37de4557c915de3d1745d78@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Snugfest\, the annual celebration of music\, art\, sustainable
  fashion\, and community\, returns to the heart of the Green Mountains on 
 Sunday\, September 13\, 2026\, at the Middlebury Snowbowl in Hancock\, Ver
 mont. All festival proceeds benefit The Snug Foundation\, a 501(c)(3) nonp
 rofit dedicated to promoting kindness and compassion toward animals\, peop
 le\, and the planet. This year’s musical lineup features Mike & Tessa Go
 rdon\, Jen Hartswick\, Nick Cassarino\, Nate Edgar\, Ray Paczkowski\, Russ
  Lawton\, Bob Wagner\, Hot Pickin’ Party\, and Electric Bear. Beyond the
  music\, attendees can explore an artisan market featuring Vermont makers 
 and small businesses\, participate in on-site art activities\, and enjoy f
 ood and beverages from local vendors including Viva el Sabor\, Gene’s Ch
 ili Hut\, Lincoln Peak Vineyard\, and Weird Window Brewing. The festival a
 lso celebrates handmade\, vintage\, upcycled\, and sustainably sourced goo
 ds\, reinforcing the Snug Foundation’s commitment to more sustainable wa
 ys of living.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Middlebury Snowbowl\, 6886 Vermont Rte 125
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/snugfest-1
 1-08-2026-12-15-20
END:VEVENT
